{"seq":3,"slug":"robustness-degeneracy","title":"鲁棒性与退化：几何程序为何会撒谎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/foundations/robustness-degeneracy","wordCount":2046,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"鲁棒性与退化-几何程序为何会撒谎\">鲁棒性与退化：几何程序为何会撒谎</h1><p>一个在纸上完全正确、在教科书里逻辑无懈可击的凸包算法，喂进真实浮点坐标后，可能构造出一个自相交的多边形、跳过某些应有的顶点，甚至陷入死循环。原因不在逻辑，而在算术：几何谓词假设自己能精确判断一个值是正、负还是零，而 IEEE 754 双精度浮点做不到——它会把本该为零的有向面积算成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-16}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级的微小正数，让「共线」被误判为「左转」，于是整个算法沿着错误分支狂奔。这一节讲清这类失效的机理，以及计算几何界发展出的两条防线：精确算术与退化处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>鲁棒性问题的根源是「组合决策依赖数值判断」。几何算法通过一连串谓词的符号来做离散的拓扑决策（弹栈还是不弹、翻边还是不翻），而这些符号来自有限精度的浮点运算。一旦某个符号算错，得到的不是「稍有误差的答案」，而是一个拓扑上不一致、逻辑上不可能的结构——错误不是连续的，而是灾难性的。这与数值分析里「误差可控地传播」很不一样，见 <a href=\"../../numerical-methods/error-stability/error-propagation\">数值方法·误差传播</a>。</p>\n<p>退化（degeneracy）则是另一类麻烦：三点共线、四点共圆、两点重合、线段端点恰好落在另一条线段上——这些「恰好相等」的特殊输入让谓词返回零，而许多算法的教科书版本假设「一般位置」（general position），没为零这个分支写正确逻辑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[几何算法] --&gt; B[一连串谓词决策]&#10;  B --&gt; C{符号来自浮点运算}&#10;  C --&gt;|舍入误差| D[符号算错]&#10;  C --&gt;|恰好相等| E[退化: 返回零]&#10;  D --&gt; F[拓扑不一致&lt;br/&gt;自相交/死循环/崩溃]&#10;  E --&gt; G[未处理的分支&lt;br/&gt;漏解/异常]&#10;  D --&gt; H1[对策: 精确/自适应算术]&#10;  E --&gt; H2[对策: 符号扰动 SoS]\">graph TD\n  A[几何算法] --&gt; B[一连串谓词决策]\n  B --&gt; C{符号来自浮点运算}\n  C --&gt;|舍入误差| D[符号算错]\n  C --&gt;|恰好相等| E[退化: 返回零]\n  D --&gt; F[拓扑不一致&lt;br/&gt;自相交/死循环/崩溃]\n  E --&gt; G[未处理的分支&lt;br/&gt;漏解/异常]\n  D --&gt; H1[对策: 精确/自适应算术]\n  E --&gt; H2[对策: 符号扰动 SoS]</pre><p>下表对比三类算术策略在正确性、速度与实现难度上的权衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>正确性</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素浮点</td>\n<td>不保证，近退化时出错</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>直接用 double</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精确算术（大整数/有理数）</td>\n<td>完全正确</td>\n<td>慢 10–100 倍</td>\n<td>GMP、CGAL::Exact_predicates</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应精度浮点</td>\n<td>完全正确</td>\n<td>平均接近浮点</td>\n<td>Shewchuk 的 robust predicates</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区间算术 + 惰性求值</td>\n<td>保证或回退</td>\n<td>快，回退时慢</td>\n<td>CGAL 惰性核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"浮点为什么骗人-一个具体的失效\">浮点为什么骗人：一个具体的失效</h2><p>考虑转向测试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>orient</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{orient}(A,B,C) = (B_x-A_x)(C_y-A_y) - (B_y-A_y)(C_x-A_x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">orient</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当三点几乎共线时，两个乘积项几乎相等，它们的差是两个相近大数相减——这是浮点最经典的「灾难性抵消」（catastrophic cancellation）场景，有效数字大量丢失，符号完全可能算反。更隐蔽的是不一致性：算法在不同地方对同一组点算 orient，若中间表达式的求值顺序不同，可能一次得正、一次得负，于是算法「认为」点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 既在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 左边又在右边，拓扑结构随即崩坏。</p>\n<p>这不是理论担忧。Kettner、Mehlhorn、Pion、Schirra 与 Yap 在 2008 年的经典论文《Classroom Examples of Robustness Problems in Geometric Computations》里，用几个精心构造的输入让标准 Graham 扫描凸包算法给出可见的错误结果，是这一领域最广为引用的警世案例。它揭示的教训是：几何算法的正确性证明默认谓词精确，而浮点破坏了这个前提，正确性就不再成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精确算术与自适应精度\">精确算术与自适应精度</h2><p>第一条防线是让谓词真正精确。由于谓词只需要正确的符号，而输入坐标常常是整数或有限精度小数，可以用任意精度整数（big integer）或有理数精确地算出符号，绝不出错。代价是慢——每次运算都在软件里模拟大数，比硬件浮点慢一两个数量级。</p>\n<p>Jonathan Shewchuk 1997 年的自适应精度谓词是这条路上的里程碑（论文《Adaptive Precision Floating-Point Arithmetic and Fast Robust Geometric Predicates》）。它的思想优雅：先用普通浮点快速估算，同时算出一个误差上界；如果估算值的绝对值明显大于误差界，符号就可信，直接返回；只有当估算值逼近零、落进误差界内时，才逐级增加精度重算，直到符号确定。因为绝大多数真实输入并不处于退化边缘，这套方法平均速度接近纯浮点，最坏情况才付出精确算术的代价。这正是上一节提到的「谓词度数决定成本」的实践落点，见 <a href=\"geometric-primitives\">几何图元与谓词</a>。</p>\n<p>工业界的 CGAL 把这套思想产品化为「精确谓词、非精确构造」（Exact Predicates Inexact Constructions）内核，配合区间算术做惰性求值：先用区间快速判断，区间不含零就直接定论，含零才回退到精确算术。这让工程师既拿到正确性保证，又不必忍受全程精确算术的慢，详见 <a href=\"../practice/computational-geometry-in-practice\">应用与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退化处理-符号扰动的魔法\">退化处理：符号扰动的魔法</h2><p>第二条防线针对「恰好相等」的退化输入。手工为每个零分支写特判既繁琐又易错，随着输入的退化组合增多几乎不可维护。Edelsbrunner 与 Mücke 1990 年提出的「模拟简单性」（Simulation of Simplicity，SoS）给出一个系统方案：想象给每个输入坐标加上一个无穷小的、互不相同的符号扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>，使得任何谓词都不再精确为零——所有退化在概念上被「扰动开」，算法只需处理正、负两个分支。这些 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 不真的参与数值计算，而是通过对多项式展开中最高阶非零项定符号来解析地决定，因此不引入任何数值误差。</p>\n<p>SoS 的效果是让算法可以假装输入永远处于一般位置，从而大幅简化代码，同时保证对退化输入也给出一个一致、确定的答案。它的取舍在于：得到的答案是「某种一致的解释」，未必符合某个特定应用对退化情形的期望语义，所以在需要精确区分共线、共圆的场合仍需谨慎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程上的务实取舍\">工程上的务实取舍</h2><p>不是每个项目都要上精确算术。务实的判断链是这样的：如果坐标是整数且量级有限（如像素、地图整数网格），把谓词用 64 位或 128 位整数精确算，通常零成本地解决大部分问题；如果是浮点科学数据且对拓扑正确性敏感（如网格生成、布尔运算），用 Shewchuk 谓词或 CGAL 惰性内核；如果只是可视化、碰撞检测这类容忍偶尔小错的场景，加一个几何容差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 把「近似相等」当相等处理，也能工作，但要警惕容差本身会引入不一致（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\approx b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\approx c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\approx c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>）。选择的核心是问自己：一次符号判断错误，会导致答案略有偏差，还是导致整个结构崩坏？后者必须上精确防线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>几何算法把离散拓扑决策建立在浮点符号判断上，一次符号算错带来的不是小误差而是拓扑灾难，这使鲁棒性成为计算几何的独特难题。</li>\n<li>灾难性抵消让近退化输入的谓词符号极易算反，Kettner 等 2008 年的经典反例展示了标准凸包算法如何因此失败。</li>\n<li>精确算术（大整数/有理数）保证正确但慢；Shewchuk 的自适应精度谓词平均接近浮点、最坏才精确，是主流方案；CGAL 用精确谓词加惰性区间算术产品化。</li>\n<li>退化输入用 Edelsbrunner-Mücke 的符号扰动（SoS）系统消解，让算法假装输入永远一般位置。</li>\n<li>工程取舍取决于坐标类型与错误后果：整数坐标常可精确整数解决，拓扑敏感场景须上精确防线，容差法要防传递性失效。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>谓词的度数如何决定精度成本：<a href=\"geometric-primitives\">几何图元与谓词</a>。</li>\n<li>精确内核在工业库里的落地：<a href=\"../practice/computational-geometry-in-practice\">应用与边界</a>。</li>\n<li>浮点与误差的系统理论：<a href=\"../../numerical-methods/error-stability/floating-point\">数值方法·浮点数</a>。</li>\n<li>精度陷阱的更多案例：<a href=\"../../numerical-methods/error-stability/precision-pitfalls\">数值方法·精度陷阱</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"鲁棒性与退化：几何程序为何会撒谎","id":"鲁棒性与退化-几何程序为何会撒谎"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"浮点为什么骗人：一个具体的失效","id":"浮点为什么骗人-一个具体的失效"},{"level":2,"text":"精确算术与自适应精度","id":"精确算术与自适应精度"},{"level":2,"text":"退化处理：符号扰动的魔法","id":"退化处理-符号扰动的魔法"},{"level":2,"text":"工程上的务实取舍","id":"工程上的务实取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"几何图元与谓词：叉积决定一切","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/foundations/geometric-primitives"},"next":{"title":"凸包算法：把橡皮筋套在钉子上","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/convex-triangulation/convex-hull"}}